<title>USA: Univec Inc makes strong debut.</title>
<headline>Univec Inc makes strong debut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Univec Inc closed Monday at 10-1/2, up 300 percent from its initial public offering price of 3-1/5 last Thursday.</p>
<p>Univec, whose IPO comprised 1.5 million shares, trades on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol.</p>
